  "description": "Identifies high-risk .NET source files and ranks them by starting priority.\n      Phase 1 cross-references git churn, code coverage, and cyclomatic complexity\n      to produce a Risk Score. Phase 2 adds Roslyn-based seam analysis (unseamed\n      infrastructure calls, direct instantiation, concrete constructor parameters,\n      static calls) to compute a Starting Priority score — so teams know both\n      where tests are needed and where they can practically begin today.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
